Scenario: Provisioning US Routing
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	End users who create requests for a US support organization for specific products and components should have their requests routed to the Provisioning - US group.

	Given I create an organization with the following values
	| Status           | Approved                                    |
	| Name             | Organization Name 1                         |
	| Tags             | liferay_dxp,liferay_portal,liferay_commerce |
	| Shared Tickets   | true                                        |
	| Shared Comments  | true                                        |
	| SLA              | Gold                                        |
	| Tier             | T4                                          |
	| Support Region   | US                                          |
	| Support Language | English                                     |
	| External ID      | 12345678                                    |
	And I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | ${staticZendeskAdminPassword}    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | Organization Name 1              |
	| Language         | English                          |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)       |
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	When I create several requests as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following product and component values
	| prd_liferay_commerce_1_1 | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_commerce_2_0 | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_commerce_2_1 | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_commerce_3_0 | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_commerce_4_0 | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_7_4      | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_7_3      | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_7_2      | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_7_1      | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_dxp_7_0      | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_portal_6_2   | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_portal_6_1   | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_portal_6_0   | activation_key_project_administration |
	| prd_liferay_portal_5_2   | activation_key_project_administration |
